# 수집기·계산·워커·마이그레이션 이미지 (포트 없음). 테스트도 이 이미지에서 실행합니다.
FROM python:3.11-slim-bookworm
ENV PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1 PIP_NO_CACHE_DIR=1 \
    ATLAS_MIGRATIONS_DIR=/app/db/migrations ATLAS_SEED_DIR=/app/seed
WORKDIR /app
COPY atlas/pyproject.toml atlas/pyproject.toml
COPY atlas/atlas atlas/atlas
RUN pip install --upgrade pip setuptools && pip install "./atlas[dev]" && useradd --system --uid 10001 --no-create-home atlas
COPY atlas/tests atlas/tests
COPY db/migrations db/migrations
COPY seed seed
USER 10001
WORKDIR /app/atlas
ENTRYPOINT ["atlas"]
CMD ["--help"]
